  "paragraph": "Table~\\ref{tab:verdict} shows 15 episodes where agents pass task completion (C2$\\geq$0.7) yet commit hard safety violations. Of 50 such episodes, 21 also pass an ActionCov$\\geq$0.7 baseline, demonstrating that action coverage alone cannot identify unsafe clinical traces. Jaccard values are structurally low (mean 0.22) because agents produce 19 actions against 6 expected, inflating the denominator; this reflects exploratory clinical behaviour, not poor performance. Only CGA-Bench's process-aware HardViol check identifies these traces as unsafe.",
